skill_serial_pacing	连载节奏管理	适配日更/周更、检测卡文、规划爆更、管理存稿	prompt	plotting	["连载", "节奏", "更新", "存稿"]	["master_plotter"]	你是连载节奏管理专家，需要帮助作者管理连载节奏。\n\n【连载信息】\n{serial_info}\n\n【更新频率】\n- 更新类型：{update_frequency}\n- 目标字数：{target_words}\n\n【连载节奏原则】\n1. **日更节奏**：每章要有小高潮，保持读者黏性\n2. **周更节奏**：章节要更完整，有更大的悬念\n3. **爆更时机**：重大剧情节点、活动期间\n4. **存稿管理**：保证质量和稳定更新\n\n【卡文检测原则】\n- 剧情推进停滞\n- 角色行为无目的\n- 场景描写冗长\n- 对话缺乏冲突\n\n请输出 JSON 格式：\n{{\n    "pacing_recommendations": {{\n        "current_chapter": 当前章节,\n        "update_frequency": "更新频率",\n        "chapter_hooks": [\n            {{\n                "chapter": 章节,\n                "hook_type": "钩子类型",\n                "hook_content": "钩子内容",\n                "optimal_position": "最佳位置"\n            }}\n        ],\n        "cliffhanger_schedule": ["悬念安排"]\n    }},\n    "writer_block_detection": {{\n        "risk_level": "卡文风险等级",\n        "warning_signs": ["预警信号"],\n        "block_causes": ["可能原因"],\n        "solutions": [\n            {{\n                "problem": "问题",\n                "solution": "解决方案",\n                "implementation": "实施方法"\n            }}\n        ]\n    }},\n    "burst_update_planning": {{\n        "recommend_burst": 是否建议爆更,\n        "burst_chapters": 爆更章节数,\n        "burst_timing": "爆更时机",\n        "burst_content_plan": ["爆更内容规划"],\n        "pre_burst_preparation": ["爆更前准备"]\n    }},\n    "manuscript_management": {{\n        "current_manuscript": 当前存稿数,\n        "recommended_buffer": 建议存稿数,\n        "writing_schedule": [\n            {{\n                "day": "日期",\n                "target_words": 目标字数,\n                "content_type": "内容类型",\n                "priority": 优先级\n            }}\n        ],\n        "emergency_plan": "紧急情况预案"\n    }},\n    "reader_retention_tactics": {{\n        "daily_teasers": ["每日预告"],\n        "interaction_points": ["互动点"],\n        "loyalty_builders": ["忠诚度建设"]\n    }}\n}}	\N	\N	\N	\N	[{"name": "serial_info", "type": "string", "default": null, "options": null, "required": true, "validation": null, "description": "连载信息"}, {"name": "update_frequency", "type": "string", "default": "daily", "options": null, "required": false, "validation": null, "description": "更新频率"}, {"name": "target_words", "type": "integer", "default": 2000, "options": null, "required": false, "validation": null, "description": "目标字数"}]	[]	0.7	\N	60	0	70	active	t	t	t	\N	\N	\N	1.0.0	system	[]	3	2026-04-13 10:32:15.763472+00	2026-04-13 08:32:29.845451+00	2026-04-13 10:32:16.061016+00	on_demand	[]	[]	[]	\N	\N	continue	f	[]	[]	[]
skill_plot_advancement	剧情推进评估	评估剧情推进效果，判断是否需要调整节奏	prompt	analysis	["剧情", "推进", "评估"]	["master_plotter"]	# 剧情推进评估技能\n\n## 任务：剧情推进评估\n\n请评估当前剧情推进情况：\n\n### 评估内容\n\n{{content_to_evaluate}}\n\n### 评估维度\n\n#### 1. 节奏评估\n\n- 剧情推进是否过快/过慢\n- 高潮和缓冲是否合理分布\n- 读者可能感到无聊的地方\n\n#### 2. 逻辑评估\n\n- 情节发展是否合理\n- 因果关系是否清晰\n- 是否有逻辑漏洞\n\n#### 3. 吸引力评估\n\n- 是否能保持读者兴趣\n- 是否有足够的悬念\n- 是否有意外惊喜\n\n#### 4. 一致性评估\n\n- 与大纲是否一致\n- 人物行为是否合理\n- 设定是否冲突\n\n### 输出格式（JSON）\n\n```json\n{\n  "overall_score": 85,\n  "dimensions": {\n    "pacing": {"score": 90, "comment": "评价"},\n    "logic": {"score": 85, "comment": "评价"},\n    "attraction": {"score": 80, "comment": "评价"},\n    "consistency": {"score": 85, "comment": "评价"}\n  },\n  "issues": ["问题1", "问题2"],\n  "suggestions": ["建议1", "建议2"],\n  "adjustment_needed": true/false\n}\n```	\N	\N	\N	\N	[{"name": "content_to_evaluate", "type": "string", "required": true, "description": "评估内容"}]	[]	0.7	\N	60	0	70	active	t	t	t	\N	\N	\N	1.0.0	system	[]	6	2026-04-14 07:23:58.008614+00	2026-04-11 04:36:37.832805+00	2026-04-14 10:13:51.336171+00	on_demand	[]	[]	[]	\N	\N	continue	f	[]	[]	[]
skill_world_expansion	世界观层次展开	规划世界观的层次展开路线，包括地图升级、势力更迭、信息揭示、战力天花板	prompt	world_building	["世界观", "层次", "展开", "规划"]	["master_plotter", "setting"]	你是世界观设计专家，需要规划世界观的层次展开路线。\n\n【当前世界观】\n{world_info}\n\n【当前进度】\n- 当前章节：{current_chapter}\n- 主角等级：{protagonist_level}\n- 已揭示区域：{revealed_areas}\n\n【世界观层次展开原则】\n1. **地图升级路线**：新手村 → 主城 → 高级区域 → 禁忌之地\n2. **势力更迭追踪**：记录各势力的兴衰变化\n3. **信息层级设计**：什么时候揭示什么信息\n4. **战力天花板提升**：世界战力上限如何随剧情提升\n\n请输出 JSON 格式：\n{{\n    "map_expansion": {{\n        "current_stage": "当前阶段",\n        "next_unlock": "下一个解锁区域",\n        "unlock_conditions": ["解锁条件"],\n        "expansion_timeline": [\n            {{"chapter_range": "1-10", "areas": ["区域列表"], "power_level": "等级范围"}}\n        ]\n    }},\n    "faction_changes": [\n        {{\n            "faction_name": "势力名称",\n            "current_status": "当前状态",\n            "planned_changes": "计划变化",\n            "change_chapter": 变化章节\n        }}\n    ],\n    "info_reveal_plan": [\n        {{\n            "info_type": "信息类型",\n            "content": "揭示内容",\n            "reveal_chapter": 揭示章节,\n            "reveal_method": "揭示方式"\n        }}\n    ],\n    "power_ceiling": {{\n        "current_max": "当前战力天花板",\n        "planned_increase": "计划提升",\n        "increase_chapter": 提升章节,\n        "reason": "提升原因"\n    }},\n    "suggestions": ["世界观展开建议"]\n}}	\N	\N	\N	\N	[{"name": "world_info", "type": "string", "default": null, "options": null, "required": true, "validation": null, "description": "世界观信息"}, {"name": "current_chapter", "type": "integer", "default": null, "options": null, "required": true, "validation": null, "description": "当前章节"}, {"name": "protagonist_level", "type": "string", "default": null, "options": null, "required": false, "validation": null, "description": "主角等级"}, {"name": "revealed_areas", "type": "string", "default": null, "options": null, "required": false, "validation": null, "description": "已揭示区域"}]	[]	0.7	\N	60	0	80	active	t	t	t	\N	\N	\N	1.0.0	system	[]	3	2026-04-13 10:32:15.612095+00	2026-04-